      "date": "2026-05-25T08:12:57.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹15.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹15.00. Ex-date: 19th August 2026 Payment date: 25th September 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.3%, which is about the same as the industry average. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (5% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (10% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 21% per year over the past 10 years and has been stable with no material reductions to payments, indicating a long track record of dividend growth and stability. Earnings per share has grown by 26% over the last 5 years. Unless this trend reverses, it should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
