      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹223 (vs ₹191 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹223 (up from ₹191 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹16.1b (up 18% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.44b (up 17% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 15% (in line with FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 23% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 34% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
